        <mxCell id="arch" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1F3864;strokeColor=#0B3D66;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="CHIEF SERVICENOW ARCHITECT  (orchestrator)&#xa;Routes — never impersonates. Clarify-first. Grounds every factual claim in ServiceNowDocs and cites the path. Reconciles specialist outputs; enforces governance." vertex="1">
